  }
 ],
 "decision_policy": {
  "per_arm": "Pass iff for every paired seed: b2 normal median - jet normal median >= 3 deg, jet normal p90 < b2 normal p90, jet centre median (bbox-diagonal fraction) <= b2's, jet coverage >= b2's, jet collapse fraction <= b2's + 0.01, jet held-out PSNR >= b2 - 0.3 dB. Reject iff jet loses on the normal median in every seed or fails the collapse gate in every seed. Else inconclusive. Collapse gate any-seed: one seed above b2 + 1 point fails the arm regardless of its other metrics. (b) b2_noanchor vs b2, jet_noanchor vs jet and vs b2_noanchor, and the jet_c ablation are descriptive; collapse controls jet_noanchor -> b2_noanchor, jet_c -> b2.",
  "predictions": "As stated in the PREREG v2.1: b2 normals 8-14 deg, centre 0.3-0.6 h-bar (marked with centre_distance_over_hbar0_median), flatness 0; b2_noanchor normals worse than b2 by >= 3 deg every seed; jet normal median < 7 deg and >= 3 deg below b2, centre <= b2, gate passed, PSNR within -0.3 dB every seed; jet_noanchor normals as good as jet but centre not better than b2_noanchor; jet_c centres inward (signed displacement negative) at ears and paws, coverage not better than jet; operator jet < b2 (seed 9561). Each is marked right/wrong in the RESULT.",
  "consequence": "No default promotion; a real-capture confirmation is a separate registration.",
  "stopping": "Fixed steps; abort a cell on non-finite loss, CUDA OOM, a finite third scale (backend check) or a splat-count change after the h0 freeze. Go/no-go before the screen: the teacher check (teacher_check)."
 },
 "decision_rule": {
  "normal_gain_deg": 3.0,
  "psnr_floor_db": -0.3,
  "collapse_margin": 0.01
 },
 "collapse_gate": {
  "h0_step": 7500,
  "neighbour_fraction_of_h0": 0.05,
  "margin_percentage_points": 1.0,
