  "random": "20000 points uniform in the ball of radius 0.5 x extent about the object-bound centre (rtgs.data.calibrated._object_bounds of the 128 training cameras and masks), float64 draws from the paired seed, isotropic scale = mean nearest-neighbour distance, opacity 0.1, colour 0.5 grey; byte-identical across the cells of a seed.",
  "reused_from": "none"
 },
 "training": {
  "configs": {
   "b2": "15000 steps, gsplat-default densification 500-7500 every 100 (grad 2e-4 on gsplat's gradient_2dgs, no absgrad, max 100000, opacity reset 3000 declared inert), SH degree 1 (interval 1000), masks on, random background, ssim 0.2; rasterizer gsplat-2dgs (third log-scale pinned to -inf); depth distortion 0.01 * D / s from step 3000 (s = scene_scale); centre-depth consistency 0.05 from step 7500; lambda_jet 0",
   "b2_noanchor": "b2 with centre-depth consistency 0",
   "jet": "b2 with the field prior, normal term, lambda_jet 0.1 from step 7500",
   "jet_noanchor": "b2_noanchor with the field prior, normal term, lambda_jet 0.1 from step 7500",
   "jet_c": "jet with terms normal+centre"
  },
  "surfel_regularization": "rtgs.render.gsplat_2dgs_backend.SurfelRegularization(depth_distortion, normal_consistency, distortion_start, normal_start, depth_scale=scene_scale[seed]) passed to Trainer.train(surfel_regularization=...): distortion = mean over pixels of gsplat's render_distort (L1 sum_ij w_i w_j |z_i - z_j| in camera depth, mesh units) divided by s; centre-depth consistency = mean over pixels of 1 - n_rendered . (n_from_expected_centre_depth * alpha.detach()); active for step > start.",
  "field_prior": "rtgs.optim.jet_prior.FieldPrior(weight, start=7500, terms, refresh_every=50, radius=3.0, bandwidth=1.5, n_bandwidth=6, min_gap=0.1, min_support=4.0, log_every=500) passed as Trainer.train(jet_prior=...): h0_i = mean distance to the 6 nearest centres at the first active step (frozen); pairs |c_j - c_i| < 3 h0_i, self included, refreshed every 50 steps; g_ij = exp(-|c_j - c_i|^2 / 2 (1.5 h0_i)^2); rho_j = sum_k g_jk; a_ij = (opacity_j / rho_j) g_ij; m_i = sum_j a_ij c_j / sum_j a_ij; C_i = sum_j a_ij (Sigma_j + (c_j - m_i)(c_j - m_i)^T); n_i = smallest eigenvector; guard: (l2 - l1)/l3 >= 0.1 and sum_j a_ij / max_j a_ij >= 4, else the residual is 0; r_nu = 1 - (nu_i . n_i)^2; r_c = ((c_i - m_i) . n_i)^2 / h0_i^2 (jet_c only); loss lambda_jet * mean over all splats; n_i, m_i detached; gradients into quats_i (r_nu) and means_i (r_c).",
